NAME
     ifconfig - the network interfaces

SYNOPSIS
     ifconfig [IFACE]

DESCRIPTION
     ifconfig prints each interface: its hardware address, how it was
     configured (dhcp or static), its address, mask, gateway and name
     server, the packets in and out, and what was dropped -- including
     what the policy refused.

SEE ALSO
     ip(8), netstat(1), ping(1)
